  "action_semantics": "All roles choose simultaneously. Input masks are applied; moves resolve first with old-cell exclusion and destination contention. Colour selections update next. For i=(input_t+offset) mod 3, offset=0,1,2, interactions recheck current resources/empty cells. Conflicts can therefore turn an initially legal request into a no-effect request. Transfer receiver is the first eligible role in cyclic order after the giver. Wait is always legal.",
